---
const updated = "22 March 2026";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Terms of use — NotionFlow</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --ink: #0f0e0d; --ink-2: #3d3b38; --ink-3: #7a7772;
      --paper: #faf9f7; --paper-2: #f0ede8; --paper-3: #e4e0d9;
      --accent: #3B5BDB;
      --serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
    nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); height: 64px;
      background: var(--paper); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-3);
    }
    .nav-logo { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-2); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); }
    .page-label { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: .875rem; }
    .page-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .page-updated { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-3); }
    .prose h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .875rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .prose p { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .prose li { font-size: .9875rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .375rem; }
    .prose a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .prose a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .prose strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
    footer { background: var(--paper-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-3); padding: 2rem clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); margin-top: 4rem; }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--ink-3); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Notion<span>Flow</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/templates">Templates</a></li>
    <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<div class="page">
  <p class="page-label">Legal</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="page-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Acceptance</h2>
    <p>By purchasing a template or using the NotionFlow website, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our products or services. NotionFlow is operated by [Your Name], Paris, France.</p>

    <h2>What you get with a template purchase</h2>
    <p>When you purchase a NotionFlow template you receive a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to use the template for your own business purposes. Specifically, you may:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Duplicate the template into your own Notion workspace.</li>
      <li>Customise the template for your agency or clients.</li>
      <li>Use the template with an unlimited number of your own clients.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What you may not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Resell or redistribute</strong> the template — in its original form, modified, or as part of a bundle — to other buyers.</li>
      <li><strong>Share the template link</strong> publicly or give access to people who have not purchased it.</li>
      <li><strong>Claim authorship</strong> of the template or pass it off as your own product for commercial sale.</li>
      <li>Use the template in any way that violates Notion's own terms of service.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you want to use a template as the basis for a product you sell to clients as a service (e.g. you set up the system for them as part of a consulting engagement), that is permitted. You are not permitted to resell the template itself as a digital product.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>All templates, documentation, setup guides, Loom videos, and written content on this site are the intellectual property of NotionFlow. Purchasing a template grants you a licence to use it — it does not transfer ownership or intellectual property rights.</p>

    <h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
    <p>Templates are provided "as is." While we take care to ensure they work as described, we make no warranty that they will meet every specific requirement of your business. Notion is a third-party product and we have no control over changes Notion makes to its platform.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, NotionFlow's liability for any claim arising from the use of our templates is limited to the amount you paid for the product in question. We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of France. Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of Paris, France.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they were last revised. Continued use of our products after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@notionflow.com">hello@notionflow.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
      <li><a href="/refunds">Refunds</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 NotionFlow</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>